{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-4","kind":"proposition","title":"同时垂直两条相交直线则垂直其所在平面","englishTitle":"If a straight line be set up at right angles to two straight lines which cut one another, at their common point of section, it will also be at right angles to the plane through them.","book":11,"number":4,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.4","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.4/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":4,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","contentId":"euclid-11-4","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf60df0768eefa09bd826a0f7087ac7a03b78b2b0184f7d019606a05eff57e5a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-4.statement","euclid-11-4.construction.1","euclid-11-4.construction.2","euclid-11-4.proof.1","euclid-11-4.proof.2","euclid-11-4.proof.3","euclid-11-4.proof.4","euclid-11-4.proof.5","euclid-11-4.proof.6","euclid-11-4.proof.7","euclid-11-4.proof.8","euclid-11-4.proof.9","euclid-11-4.proof.10","euclid-11-4.proof.11","euclid-11-4.proof.12","euclid-11-4.proof.13","euclid-11-4.proof.14","euclid-11-4.proof.15","euclid-11-4.conclusion","euclid-11-4.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-4.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"942289fd2e278b18564470d643bb8e229e66992022e31999435b9d2504bad3ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be set up at right angles to two straight lines which cut one another, at their common point of section, it will also be at right angles to the plane through them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在直角至2条直线上设置一条直线,在两条直线的同一处,则在直角至平面之间。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cdb28d34715ddffdb9c4eb31a672c17dd1e0065a028ccb5fce8355be42dbe76d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a straight line EF be set up at right angles to the two straight lines AB, CD, which cut one another at the point E, from E; I say that EF is also at right angles to the plane through AB, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将直线 EF设置在直角至AB直线CD,在E点将两条直线相互分隔,从E点;我说,EF直线也为直角至平面至AB,CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8fadc4d3306f24f4645241b16166f5dc5bf623e996a7b163d01f561e9b6c6a79","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AE, EB, CE, ED be cut off equal to one another, and let any straight line GEH be drawn across through E, at random; let AD, CB be joined, and further let FA, FG, FD, FC, FH, FB be joined from the point F taken at random lton EFgt."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AE,EB,CE,ED等离线,将GEH直线任意划过E线;将AD,CB连线,并将FA,FG,FD,FC,FH,FB从随机的伊登EFgt拍摄的F点连线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"932891ee42408e7e8219f43ebb0ddbce9174452d0e35c3e6b5511de6e4d0dbd6","citations":["euclid-1-15","euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the two straight lines AE, ED are equal to the two straight lines CE, EB, and contain equal angles, [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] therefore the base AD is equal to the base CB, and the triangle AED will be equal to the triangle CEB; [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] so that the angle DAE is also equal to the angle EBC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于两条直线AE,ED等于两条直线CE,EB, 并包含相等角度, 因此底边,AD等于底边,CB, 三角形AED等于三角形CEB; 因此, 角DAE也等于角EBC。 [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af37b0af2d1661a91cea3b894987787255654aa7e750ddadc32dacba48c43cdc","citations":["euclid-1-15","euclid-1-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle AEG is also equal to the angle BEH; [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] therefore AGE, BEH are two triangles which have two angles equal to two angles respectively, and one side equal to one side, namely that adjacent to the equal angles, that is to say, AE to EB; therefore they will also have the remaining sides equal to the remaining sides. [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AEG角也等于BEH角;因此,AGE、BEH是两个三角形,两个角分别等于两个角度,一方等于一面,即接近平等角度,即AE至EB;因此,它们也拥有其余方等于其余方。 [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25b5cb428377c03b2075c067dfd0da67eb912e1932a65caaf94edaa797ed39e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore GE is equal to EH, and AG to BH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,GE等于EH,AG至BH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad67dbd216051ee6df1bdf99172648c73c1f784753582d4e65dc75f04e68ce3d","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AE is equal to EB, while FE is common and at right angles, therefore the base FA is equal to the base FB. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE等于EB,FE是普通的,直角时,底边 FA等于底边 FB。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"54cc5986ad8b0a23aaeb678a06a2a1fcc7f2aa6dc4b4e85c52edc2a1c5f0db90","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason FC is also equal to FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,FC也等于FD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"736ce3a276c1a35b6e56c419cffc2f6d9a7d17a0a16ea2cb4577f0d024e5142e","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AD is equal to CB, and FA is also equal to FB, the two sides FA, AD are equal to the two sides FB, BC respectively; and the base FD was proved equal to the base FC; therefore the angle FAD is also equal to the angle FBC. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AD等于CB,FA也等于FB,双方FA,AD等于FB,BC;底边,FD经证明等于底边,FC;因此,角度FAD也等于角度FBC。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9221650711e813ae1b937fe08e32d3a9fe333ca5972cbfd97404d26cb4e8130a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, again, AG was proved equal to BH, and further FA also equal to FB, the two sides FA, AG are equal to the two sides FB, BH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AG被证明等于BH,另外FA也等于FB,双方FA,AG等于双方FB,BH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"65aff31fa02da6f5e8d56174ee5d5a4161d1687bb6224388561483dda27860e3","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the angle FAG was proved equal to the angle FBH; therefore the base FG is equal to the base FH. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"角度FAG 被证明等于角度FBH。 因此,底边 FG 等于 角度底边 FH。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"33c742227764e90e3641f26e3b05fe885b099ea69796262ce496679468ef1aef","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, again, GE was proved equal to EH, and EF is common, the two sides GE, EF are equal to the two sides HE, EF; and the base FG is equal to the base FH; therefore the angle GEF is equal to the angle HEF. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于GE被证明等于EH,EF很常见,双方GE,EF等于双方HE,EF;底边FG等于底边FH;因此,角度GEF等于角度HEF。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e7d8ee2f54643ce6fb38d02a11b1d5ca04d2e1f5a43d413d90922c3216d3989","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the angles GEF, HEF is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,每个角度GEF,HEF是正确的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c495084c96c3797740081d7ec1013ed138c75296426a6e84a8e01e97cd5c4fff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FE is at right angles to GH drawn at random through E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FE是直角至GH,随机抽取至E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"21e0beb314c5de2b6327737e69ea2a6b3ebd033dc8beca50e60575211ea6c704","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that FE will also make right angles with all the straight lines which meet it and are in the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,FE线也将达到直角,所有直线相互交错,并处于平面参考线之内。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"785784c1e376ded9d4e842d33242f7d7ea1cd8cc2183d61f484c91da60fea803","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But a straight line is at right angles to a plane when it makes right angles with all the straight lines which meet it and are in that same plane; [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)] therefore FE is at right angles to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但直线为直角至平面, 直线与所有相交的直线相交, 并且在同一平面; 因此, FE是直角至平面。 [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dddcfe88b97cb274d3df916b7aba465006d6d165942684a91f75fc2816b0aeb4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the plane of reference is the plane through the straight lines AB, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但参考的平面是平面 直线AB,CD"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a3b5afef07d5a853dc014e8d00e9ff960d9dfa8e72b7f3aa4a30009471f3a62","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FE is at right angles to the plane through AB, CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FE是直角至平面至AB,CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":18,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-4.source","contentId":"euclid-11-4","revisionId":"euclid-11-4@raw-cf60df0768eefa09","order":19,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3429112cae007a59006aae6c1d7e0618cbc2afbd96059c494246cd3f5c00cfe9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.4/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.4\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-4:euclid-1-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-4.proof.1","euclid-11-4.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.